age in the process, the immediate steps in order to achieve the goals must be considered.","box":[0.55,0.4735,0.3675,0.0916]},{"anchor":"s797-s796","text":"7. Encourage Momentum. The final stage of ACHIEVE is to encourage momentum - both towards goals - and between coaching sessions.","box":[0.55,0.7578,0.3675,0.0916]},{"anchor":"s2","text":"Gibbs’ Reflective Cycle","box":[0.0283,0.0378,0.9417,0.0673]}],"warnings":[],"stats":{"objects":74,"textBlocks":16},"reconstructedSlots":[{"anchor":"text-0","text":"Align on Coaching ","box":[0.2458444528013748,0.26958479704680266,0.08810175858989834,0.016692578351056135],"origin":[0.2458444528013748,0.28293886537905094],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":9.013999938964844,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu Sans"},{"anchor":"text-1","text":"Agreement","box":[0.2623796991441493,0.2895848309552228,0.052064732231553654,0.016692578351056135],"origin":[0.2623796991441493,0.3029388992874711],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":9.013999938964844,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu Sans"},{"anchor":"text-2","text":"Clarify ","box":[0.3734317218833356,0.3594014768247251,0.03299470811336787,0.016692578351056135],"origin":[0.3734317218833356,0.3727555451569734],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":9.013999938964844,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu Sans"},{"anchor":"text-3","text":"motivation","box":[0.3632151731903175,0.37940151073314526,0.050365269558157504,0.016692578351056135],"origin":[0.3632151731903175,0.39275557906539355],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":9.013999938964844,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu Sans"},{"anchor":"text-4","text":"Hold self-","box":[0.14167151711240436,0.5377736974645544,0.04369869084058887,0.016692606608072917],"origin":[0.14167151711240436,0.5511277940538194],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":9.013999938964844,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu Sans"},{"anchor":"text-5","text":"discovery ","box":[0.14105173028194468,0.557773674858941,0.04801785515037865,0.016692606608072917],"origin":[0.14105173028194468,0.571127771448206],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":9.013999938964844,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu 